OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies stunned by disabled
OL,4,Aadults day centre closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FRelatives of adults with disabilities
OL,7,Fwho attend a Cheshire day centre say
OL,8,Fthey feel like their loved ones "don't
OL,9,Fmatter" after news emerged of its
OL,10,Fplanned closure.
OL,12,FCheshire West and Chester Council
OL,13,F(CWAC) is going to shut the Coronation
OL,14,FCentre - which provides daytime
OL,15,Factivities for people with learning
OL,16,Fdisabilities - in Ellesmere Port by
OL,17,FMarch 2027.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1794770725
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies stunned by disabled
OL,4,Aadults day centre closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaylor, whose sister Chelsea goes to
OL,7,Fthe support centre, said it was "very
OL,8,Fupsetting and very frustrating" and
OL,9,Fthat "life-changing" decisions had been
OL,10,Fmade without the affected families'
OL,11,Finvolvement.
OL,13,FCWAC said the move was "not the
OL,14,Fwithdrawal of care and support" and
OL,15,Fthat every individual's needs would be
OL,16,Freviewed.
